  "note": "工地 (native:guanbei/fence_gate, tents, sheds, diggings; 关北 C): the 兵部's camp on the steppe — a stake fence across the grass with the gate in it and the board over it, 吕隼's table with his ledgers, three white tents under the 兵部's white flags with the three-legged bird, two long thatched sheds open at the front with the shackle posts in a row before them and the watch fire, the diggings east: pits with ladders, the windlass over the deep one, spoil heaps, baskets and poles dropped where the men stopped, cart ruts to the barrow. Trodden yellow earth over the grass, dung, broken carrying poles, blood on the posts.",
